  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Disectoid.png\" title=\"Shadow Fade Disectoid\"><img alt=\"Shadow Fade Disectoid\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"208\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Disectoid.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Disectoid.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Fade Disectoid</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fodder\n</p><p>Disectoids/Hatchlings are small spider like creatures who usually come in large groups. They are not very bothersome and are best dealt with by an area attack such as Ring of Fire, or Shadow Lightning.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Disectoid\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ebon Hatchling\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tomb_of_Singe\" title=\"Tomb of Singe\">Tomb of Singe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a> Level 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Fade Hatchling\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Choppe's Shoppe</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a> Level 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hatchling Scout\n</td><td> --\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>, Level 5\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<ul><li> A <b>Widower's Hatchling</b> is spawned in groups only by the <a href=\"/wiki/Widow_Maker\" title=\"Widow Maker\">Widow Maker</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">Widow Maker's Lair</a>\n</li></ul>\n<ul><li> <b>Lava Hatchlings</b> are spawned by <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Rachnid\" title=\"Lava Rachnid\">Lava Rachnids</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
